---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Apply an independently pinned plan, revalidating unchanged releases

Usage: leptoskit workspace deploy [OPTIONS] --plan <PLAN> --sha256 <SHA256>

Options:
      --manifest <MANIFEST>
          Workspace manifest; otherwise locate it from the current directory
      --plan <PLAN>
          Reviewed JSON plan written by workspace plan
      --sha256 <SHA256>
          Independently reviewed SHA-256 of the exact plan bytes
      --timeout-seconds <TIMEOUT_SECONDS>
          Maximum seconds for each application's local release process tree [default: 900]
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
